@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> Uploading Audio : User uploads a new audio file
Uploading Audio --> Viewing Audio : Audio file is available to view
Viewing Audio --> Searching and Sharing : User searches and shares audio files
Searching and Sharing --> Viewing Audio : Return to viewing after sharing
Viewing Audio --> Deleting Audio : User decides to delete an audio file
Deleting Audio --> Viewing Audio : Return to viewing after deletion
Viewing Audio --> [*] : User exits the system
@enduml
